[{"text": "and the assembly will hear an address by", "start": 1.92, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "his excellency William Samoi Ruto,", "start": 6.16, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "president of the Republic of Kenya and", "start": 10.08, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "the commander-in-chief of defense", "start": 12.24, "duration": 3.04}, {"text": "forces.", "start": 13.759, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 15.28, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 17.84, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 20.48, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President of the General Assembly,", "start": 33.84, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General, excellencies,", "start": 38.399, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 41.6, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "81 years ago, the nations gathered in", "start": 44.48, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "San Francisco", "start": 49.12, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "spoke from the ruins of war.", "start": 51.039, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "They resolved to save succeeding", "start": 54.399, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "generations from its scouch.", "start": 57.44, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "They reaffirmed faith in human dignity", "start": 61.84, "duration": 8.639}, {"text": "and in the equal rights of nations large", "start": 66.32, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "and small.", "start": 70.479, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "and they pledged social progress, better", "start": 73.2, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "standards of life and the economic and", "start": 76.96, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "social advancement", "start": 80.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "of all peoples.", "start": 82.08, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "These were not mere words. They were the", "start": 85.84, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "foundations of a new global order.", "start": 90.0, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "Peace over war, law over force,", "start": 93.84, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "sovereign equality over dependency,", "start": 98.32, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "cooperation", "start": 101.68, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "over division, and human dignity over", "start": 103.439, "duration": 8.201}, {"text": "ambitions of power.", "start": 107.68, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "On 16th December 1963,", "start": 111.68, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "four days after our independence,", "start": 115.759, "duration": 8.801}, {"text": "Kenya took its seat in this assembly.", "start": 119.52, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "We arrived with one vote", "start": 124.56, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "and the same sovereign rights as every", "start": 127.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "other state.", "start": 131.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "The promise made in San Francisco now", "start": 133.76, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "belonged to us as well.", "start": 136.48, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "And that promise changed the world. When", "start": 141.28, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "the United Nations was founded, some 750", "start": 144.0, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "million people lived under colonial", "start": 148.56, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "rule.", "start": 151.76, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "At San Francisco, only four African", "start": 153.76, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "countries were represented while most of", "start": 157.12, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "our continent", "start": 160.72, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "remained under colonial rule.", "start": 162.64, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Decolonization transformed the map of", "start": 166.239, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the world, replacing colonial", "start": 169.12, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "subjugation with self-determination.", "start": 171.519, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "As peoples once governed from afar took", "start": 175.519, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "their place in this assembly as", "start": 179.36, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "sovereign equals.", "start": 183.28, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "The United Nations also made a", "start": 186.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "difference where peace had been broken.", "start": 188.64, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "It helped Namibia achieve independence,", "start": 192.08, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "supported Cambodia's transition from", "start": 195.68, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "conflict, disarmed combatants in Sierra", "start": 198.239, "duration": 9.041}, {"text": "Leon and Liberia, and helped Timo Leel", "start": 202.159, "duration": 10.561}, {"text": "take its place among sovereign nations.", "start": 207.28, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "More than two million peacekeepers", "start": 212.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "have served under the UN flag, proving", "start": 215.36, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "that peace can be built,", "start": 218.48, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "protected, and sustained.", "start": 221.28, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Its impact reached further into the", "start": 224.959, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "lives of ordinary people. The United", "start": 227.68, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Nations system helped eradicate small", "start": 230.4, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "pox, vaccinated generations of children,", "start": 233.2, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "fight hunger and disease, expand access", "start": 237.68, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "to education, and bring clean water and", "start": 241.12, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "humanitarian assistance to communities", "start": 244.159, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "across the world.", "start": 247.2, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "Since the year 2000, deaths among", "start": 250.879, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "children under five have fallen by more", "start": 254.159, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "than half.", "start": 257.28, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "These achievements matter.", "start": 260.079, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "They changed borders,", "start": 263.52, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "ended wars, defeated disease, and", "start": 265.84, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "transformed lives.", "start": 270.08, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "They tell us", "start": 272.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "that multilateralism", "start": 275.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "works when nations summon the will to", "start": 277.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "make it work.", "start": 281.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "The United Nations has not fulfilled", "start": 283.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "every promise of its charter.", "start": 286.0, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "But without it, our world would have", "start": 289.44, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "been poorer,", "start": 292.479, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "more dangerous, and less free.", "start": 294.32, "duration": 8.96}, {"text": "That is why Kenya speaks today,", "start": 299.12, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "not from despair in this institution,", "start": 303.28, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "but from conviction in its", "start": 307.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "possibilities.", "start": 310.479, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "Yet conviction in what this institution", "start": 313.36, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "can be requires us to confront what this", "start": 316.72, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "institution has become.", "start": 322.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Distinguished delegates,", "start": 325.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "last year the world recorded 65", "start": 327.36, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "statebased armed conflicts, the highest", "start": 331.68, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "number of documented incidences in eight", "start": 335.199, "duration": 8.641}, {"text": "digits of global conflict data.", "start": 338.88, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "13 reached the scale of war. Nearly a", "start": 343.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "quarter of a million people were killed", "start": 347.12, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "in organized violence.", "start": 349.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Interstate conflicts doubled for the", "start": 352.639, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "second consecutive year.", "start": 355.36, "duration": 9.76}, {"text": "Their number quadrupled from 2 to 8.", "start": 358.8, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "One-sided violence against civilians", "start": 365.12, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "reached levels not witnessed since 1994,", "start": 368.08, "duration": 9.36}, {"text": "the year of genocide in Rwanda.", "start": 372.72, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "From Europe to the Middle East, from", "start": 377.44, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "Sahel to the Horn of Africa, civilians", "start": 380.8, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "are paying the ultimate price.", "start": 384.4, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "Cities are destroyed.", "start": 388.24, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Families are displaced.", "start": 390.639, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "Hunger deepens. Supply chains are", "start": 392.96, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "disrupted, driving up the cost of food,", "start": 396.08, "duration": 8.559}, {"text": "fuel, and essential goods far beyond the", "start": 400.4, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "battlefield.", "start": 404.639, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Children inherit wars they did not begin", "start": 406.56, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "and cannot understand.", "start": 410.8, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Too many disputes are no longer being", "start": 414.08, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "settled. They are being frozen,", "start": 416.88, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "deferred,", "start": 420.56, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "or decided by force.", "start": 422.08, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "This is precisely what the charter", "start": 426.08, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "was created to prevent.", "start": 430.319, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "It did not ask the United Nations merely", "start": 432.72, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "to describe war or count victims or", "start": 435.759, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "organize relief after diplomacy has", "start": 440.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "failed.", "start": 443.12, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "It gave this organization,", "start": 444.88, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "the United Nations, a duty to prevent", "start": 448.479, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "conflict, defend peace, and make", "start": 452.319, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "collective security real.", "start": 456.4, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "It also charged it to advance the", "start": 460.639, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "economic and social well-being of all", "start": 463.68, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "peoples.", "start": 466.72, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Peace and prosperity were never two", "start": 468.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "mandates.", "start": 472.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "They were one promise.", "start": 474.16, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "Today both sides of that promise are", "start": 477.52, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "under strain.", "start": 480.319, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "The crisis of multilateralism", "start": 482.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "is not a shortage of commitments,", "start": 484.56, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "institutions or rules.", "start": 487.84, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "It is the widening distance between the", "start": 491.52, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "equality this system proclaims", "start": 495.36, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "and the inequality that is inherent in", "start": 499.28, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "its structures.", "start": 503.039, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "That is precisely why we cannot accept", "start": 505.919, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "its present limitations", "start": 509.759, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "on peace and security. The contradiction", "start": 514.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "is increasingly", "start": 517.2, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "difficult to ignore.", "start": 519.44, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Every nation in this hall has one vote.", "start": 522.08, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Every nation is sovereign and equal", "start": 526.16, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "under the charter.", "start": 529.12, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "Yet on the gravest question of war and", "start": 531.36, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "peace,", "start": 536.08, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "five nations possess a permanent power", "start": 537.839, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "that the other 188 do not.", "start": 541.76, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "The equality proclaimed in this assembly", "start": 546.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "ends at the doors of the security", "start": 550.24, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "council.", "start": 553.519, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "That imbalance", "start": 556.16, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "might have reflected the world of 1945.", "start": 558.0, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "It does not reflect", "start": 562.959, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "the world that we know today.", "start": 565.519, "duration": 9.521}, {"text": "Africa has 54 member states, more than a", "start": 570.16, "duration": 9.119}, {"text": "quarter of this assembly, yet no", "start": 575.04, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "permanent voice in the body entrusted", "start": 579.279, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "with the primary responsibility", "start": 582.48, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "of international peace and security.", "start": 585.12, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "We are", "start": 589.6, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "we are frequently the subject of its", "start": 595.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "decisions.", "start": 598.48, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Permanently discussed yet permanently", "start": 600.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "excluded.", "start": 604.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "The problem is not that the world lacks", "start": 607.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "law.", "start": 610.48, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "It is", "start": 612.32, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "that confidence in its consistent", "start": 614.32, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "application is weakening.", "start": 617.04, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "International law cannot be invoked", "start": 620.64, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "loudly in one crisis,", "start": 623.519, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "cautiously in another crisis", "start": 626.56, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "and disregarded when convenient.", "start": 629.92, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "Every perceived double standard carries", "start": 634.64, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "a price and that price is trust.", "start": 638.399, "duration": 9.921}, {"text": "Trust cannot be restored by declaration.", "start": 643.68, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "It must be earned", "start": 648.32, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "by consistent application.", "start": 650.72, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "But the cost of failure is measured", "start": 655.68, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "in more than lost trust.", "start": 659.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "It is measured in children driven from", "start": 662.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "their classrooms.", "start": 665.68, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Children who go to sleep hungry,", "start": 667.839, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "children who learn the sound of gunfire", "start": 670.959, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "before they know the safety of peace.", "start": 674.32, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "When collective security breaks down,", "start": 678.399, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "schools close,", "start": 681.839, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "hospitals collapse, families flee, and", "start": 683.92, "duration": 8.76}, {"text": "economies are consumed by war.", "start": 687.44, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "Peace is not separate from development.", "start": 694.0, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "It is its first condition.", "start": 698.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "When the institutions entrusted with", "start": 701.519, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "peace fail,", "start": 703.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "it is too often the youngest who inherit", "start": 705.839, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the consequences.", "start": 709.36, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 711.839, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Africa", "start": 714.399, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "exposes this contradiction most clearly.", "start": 716.399, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "In 1945,", "start": 721.76, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "most of our continent could not speak", "start": 723.68, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "for itself as San Francisco because it", "start": 725.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "remained under colonial rule.", "start": 728.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Only four African states were", "start": 731.92, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "represented.", "start": 734.24, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "The architecture of collective security", "start": 735.92, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "was therefore designed at a moment when", "start": 738.959, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "most Africans had neither a nation at", "start": 742.079, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "the table nor a voice in shaping the", "start": 745.36, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "institutions that it would govern the", "start": 748.639, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "peace.", "start": 751.04, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "The world, ladies and gentlemen, has", "start": 753.12, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "since transformed.", "start": 755.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "The council,", "start": 758.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "the security council", "start": 760.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "has not.", "start": 763.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "We cannot manage transformation with", "start": 765.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "institutions that refuse to transform", "start": 768.48, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "themselves.", "start": 771.36, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "The test of equality does not end with", "start": 773.519, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "the institutions that govern peace.", "start": 777.519, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "It extends to the institutions that", "start": 781.6, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "shape prosperity.", "start": 783.839, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "The same question confronts us there.", "start": 786.399, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "Does the international financial system", "start": 790.32, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "give every nation a fair opportunity to", "start": 794.079, "duration": 10.121}, {"text": "secure the well-being of its citizens.", "start": 798.32, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "The charter did not conceive development", "start": 805.6, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "as charity.", "start": 808.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "It pledged social progress, better", "start": 810.56, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "standards of life, and economic and", "start": 814.16, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "social advancement for all people.", "start": 817.2, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "Yet for too many countries, the", "start": 822.399, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "resources required to fulfill that", "start": 825.279, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "promise are being consumed before they", "start": 827.279, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "can reach their people.", "start": 830.639, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "Global public debt reached a record $12", "start": 834.079, "duration": 8.641}, {"text": "trillion in 2024.", "start": 838.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Developing countries accounted for less", "start": 842.72, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "than a third of that debt, yet paid", "start": 845.519, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "about a trillion dollar in interest on", "start": 849.199, "duration": 9.521}, {"text": "debt in that year alone.", "start": 853.44, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "Put it differently,", "start": 858.72, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "46 developing countries now spend more", "start": 860.72, "duration": 11.52}, {"text": "on interest on debt than on classrooms", "start": 865.6, "duration": 10.039}, {"text": "and medicine.", "start": 872.24, "duration": 3.399}, {"text": "Behind these numbers lies a simple", "start": 877.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "reality.", "start": 880.959, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "The hospital competes with a creditor.", "start": 882.959, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "The classroom competes with debt", "start": 887.279, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "service.", "start": 889.76, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "And too often", "start": 891.519, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "the creditor", "start": 893.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "debt service is paid first.", "start": 895.76, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "And it is our children who inherit the", "start": 900.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "consequences. Today,", "start": 902.88, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "251", "start": 906.16, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "million children and young people remain", "start": 907.68, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "out of school. Millions more enter", "start": 910.079, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "classrooms without teachers, books,", "start": 913.6, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "meals, and facilities they need to", "start": 916.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "learn.", "start": 919.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "When debt service displaces investment", "start": 921.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "in education, we are not merely", "start": 924.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "balancing budgets.", "start": 927.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "We are transferring the cost of today's", "start": 929.839, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "financial burden", "start": 932.48, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "to the next generation of citizens.", "start": 934.8, "duration": 9.039}, {"text": "Kenya has chosen to invest", "start": 940.16, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "in the next generation. Over the last", "start": 943.839, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "four years, we have spent an additional", "start": 946.56, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "$5.3 billion in education,", "start": 950.56, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "recruited 100,000 additional teachers,", "start": 953.92, "duration": 9.2}, {"text": "build more than 23,000 new classrooms,", "start": 958.48, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "and we are developing another 1,600", "start": 963.12, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "laboratories while expanding support for", "start": 966.24, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "universities and technical institutions.", "start": 969.04, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "We do this because education", "start": 973.04, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "is not consumption. It is the", "start": 976.32, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "infrastructure of opportunity,", "start": 979.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "productivity and national transformation", "start": 982.079, "duration": 8.041}, {"text": "that supports global advancement.", "start": 985.36, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "But national effort can only go so far", "start": 990.399, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "when the international financial system", "start": 994.0, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "makes development", "start": 997.199, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "more expensive.", "start": 999.279, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "The countries that most need capital", "start": 1001.759, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "frequently pay the highest price to", "start": 1005.36, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "obtain it.", "start": 1008.0, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Developing countries have recently", "start": 1010.079, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "borrowed at rates", "start": 1012.0, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "two to four times higher on average than", "start": 1014.72, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "developed nations.", "start": 1019.519, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "The question therefore is available.", "start": 1022.32, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "It is who can access it, at what price,", "start": 1026.319, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "for how long, and under whose assessment", "start": 1030.48, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "of risk.", "start": 1034.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Africa knows the cost of that", "start": 1037.28, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "assessment.", "start": 1039.76, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Sovereign created rating", "start": 1042.16, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "shapes perceptions of risk,", "start": 1045.28, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "the interest countries pay, and even the", "start": 1048.96, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "volume of finance available to them.", "start": 1052.24, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "UNDP estimates that subjectivities in", "start": 1056.64, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "credit ratings have cost African", "start": 1060.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "countries approximately $75 billion", "start": 1062.96, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "through excessive interest and forgone", "start": 1066.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "lending.", "start": 1069.52, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Risk, ladies and gentlemen, must be", "start": 1071.6, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "measured, but it must also be measured", "start": 1074.4, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "fairly.", "start": 1079.52, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "We cannot build a fair global economy if", "start": 1084.64, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "the nations with the greatest", "start": 1088.799, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "development needs face the highest cost", "start": 1090.48, "duration": 7.079}, {"text": "of development finance.", "start": 1093.679, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "A road that is commercially viable", "start": 1098.08, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "should not become unviable merely", "start": 1100.64, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "because it crosses an African border.", "start": 1103.28, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "A power project should not cost more", "start": 1107.2, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "simply because of the passport of the", "start": 1110.799, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "country", "start": 1113.28, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "it is building.", "start": 1115.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Capital must price risk.", "start": 1117.679, "duration": 9.0}, {"text": "It must not price prejudice.", "start": 1121.2, "duration": 5.479}, {"text": "Reform of the international financial", "start": 1128.64, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "architecture must therefore begin with a", "start": 1130.559, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "cost and availability of capital.", "start": 1132.88, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "The UN charter envisaged multilateral", "start": 1136.559, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "development banks that lend more, lend", "start": 1140.24, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "longer, and mobilize private capital at", "start": 1144.0, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "scale.", "start": 1147.76, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "It further contemplated guarantees and", "start": 1149.84, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "risk sharing instruments that reduce the", "start": 1153.28, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "cost of viable investments.", "start": 1156.16, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "And we need greater access to long-term", "start": 1159.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "and local currency finance so that", "start": 1162.799, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "countries are not forced to build", "start": 1165.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "long-term infrastructure with short-term", "start": 1167.84, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "expensive money.", "start": 1171.12, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "And by the way, this is not an argument", "start": 1174.08, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "against responsibility.", "start": 1178.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Governments", "start": 1181.679, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "must also do their part to manage debt", "start": 1183.52, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "prudently, strengthen institutions,", "start": 1187.2, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "prepare pipelines of credible projects,", "start": 1191.28, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "deepen domestic capital markets,", "start": 1195.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "honor contracts,", "start": 1199.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and confront corruption without", "start": 1201.84, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "equivocation.", "start": 1205.2, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "A fairer international system requires", "start": 1208.64, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "responsibility on both sides.", "start": 1211.2, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "Reform abroad cannot substitute for", "start": 1215.2, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "accountability at home.", "start": 1219.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Distinguished delegates,", "start": 1223.039, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "Africa does not come to plead.", "start": 1225.2, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "We come with a proposal.", "start": 1230.0, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Our continent holds fast mineral wealth.", "start": 1232.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "immense agricultural potential,", "start": 1236.72, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "extraordinary renewable energy", "start": 1239.12, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "resources, and the world's youngest", "start": 1241.28, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "population.", "start": 1244.799, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "We are a market of more than 1.5 billion", "start": 1246.96, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "people increasingly connected through", "start": 1250.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the African continental free trade area.", "start": 1252.559, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "These are not merely African assets.", "start": 1256.08, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "properly developed, they are part of the", "start": 1259.6, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "answer to the world's search for food", "start": 1262.559, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "security, clean energy, resilient supply", "start": 1265.919, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "chains, and a new source of growth.", "start": 1269.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Africa's resources must become the", "start": 1273.76, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "beginning of African industry, not the", "start": 1276.24, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "end of Africa's contribution to the", "start": 1279.28, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "value chain.", "start": 1282.64, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Extraction defined too much of our past.", "start": 1284.799, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "Investment must underpin", "start": 1290.0, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "our future.", "start": 1293.919, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "This transition", "start": 1297.039, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "is already taking shape.", "start": 1299.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Cocoa producing nations are moving from", "start": 1302.88, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "bean to brand. Cotton producers are", "start": 1305.2, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "building government value chains. And", "start": 1308.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Africa has made its position clear.", "start": 1311.52, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "The clean energy transition must not", "start": 1315.36, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "become another extractive transition.", "start": 1318.32, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "The Africa continental free trade area", "start": 1322.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "must be more than a market for what", "start": 1325.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Africa already produces. It must become", "start": 1327.44, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "the platform on which Africa makes more", "start": 1330.72, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "of what it now imports.", "start": 1334.4, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "Kenya intends to be part of that", "start": 1338.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "transformation.", "start": 1341.039, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "In the next one week, we expect to break", "start": 1343.36, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "ground on the East African refinery in", "start": 1346.32, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "Lammo.", "start": 1350.96, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "A refinery capable of producing 700,000", "start": 1353.679, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "barrels of oils of oil a day. An", "start": 1356.88, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "investment of approximately $16 billion.", "start": 1359.84, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Its significance extends beyond one", "start": 1364.08, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "project or one country. It represents", "start": 1367.2, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "the Africa we seek to build. Adding", "start": 1371.44, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "value at home, creating jobs for our", "start": 1375.28, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "people, and building industries capable", "start": 1378.159, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "of serving continents and global", "start": 1380.559, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "markets.", "start": 1383.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "That transformation should be financed", "start": 1385.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "using foreign and domestic resources.", "start": 1388.08, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "And that is what we intend to do,", "start": 1391.919, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "including the more than $4 trillion in", "start": 1394.88, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "domestic capital across pension funds,", "start": 1398.64, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "insurance assets, sovereign wealth", "start": 1401.28, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "funds, banks, and other institutions in", "start": 1403.919, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Africa.", "start": 1407.039, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "The task is to mobilize more of that", "start": 1408.72, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "capital for productive investment while", "start": 1412.159, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "building the safeguards, credible", "start": 1415.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "projects and financial instruments that", "start": 1417.76, "duration": 7.799}, {"text": "long-term investors require.", "start": 1420.88, "duration": 4.679}, {"text": "The imbalance", "start": 1426.799, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "is not only about money, it is also", "start": 1431.2, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "about voice.", "start": 1434.88, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Africa's 54 nations are home to nearly", "start": 1437.52, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "one in every five people on Earth. Yet", "start": 1440.72, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "our influence on the institutions that", "start": 1444.88, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "govern global finance remain", "start": 1447.2, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "disproportionately small.", "start": 1449.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "We cannot carry substantial obligations", "start": 1452.559, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "under a system while remaining marginal", "start": 1455.36, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "in shaping its rules.", "start": 1458.64, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "If Africa has a stake in the burden of", "start": 1461.919, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "debt, Africa must have a share in the", "start": 1464.72, "duration": 9.16}, {"text": "decisions on how that debt is acquired.", "start": 1468.559, "duration": 5.321}, {"text": "This is not a plea for special", "start": 1474.4, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "treatment.", "start": 1476.4, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "It is a proposition for shared", "start": 1477.919, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "prosperity.", "start": 1480.559, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "A more industrialized Africa expands", "start": 1482.88, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "global demand.", "start": 1485.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "A more food secure Africa strengthens", "start": 1487.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "global stability.", "start": 1490.0, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "A better connected Africa diversifies", "start": 1492.0, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "global supply chains and an Africa able", "start": 1494.96, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "to finance more of its own development", "start": 1498.72, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "becomes a stronger partner for the", "start": 1501.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "world.", "start": 1504.799, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 1506.88, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "this brings us back to the central", "start": 1508.88, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "question before this assembly.", "start": 1510.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Whether in the security council or in", "start": 1513.6, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "the international financial system,", "start": 1516.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "institutions built for another age", "start": 1518.799, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "are being asked to govern", "start": 1522.48, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "a completely different world that we", "start": 1525.44, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "live in today.", "start": 1529.12, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Restoring trust requires more than", "start": 1531.279, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "defending those institutions.", "start": 1533.84, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "It requires having the courage to reform", "start": 1536.64, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "them.", "start": 1538.64, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "This is not a conversation we are", "start": 1540.559, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "beginning today.", "start": 1542.24, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "For decades, member states have debated", "start": 1544.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "how to make the security council more", "start": 1547.279, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "representative, legitimate, and", "start": 1549.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "effective. In 2008, after years of", "start": 1552.159, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "discussion, this general assembly moved", "start": 1556.32, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "security council reform into", "start": 1559.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "intergovernmental negotiations. Those", "start": 1561.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "negotiations began the following year.", "start": 1565.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "17 years later, we are still", "start": 1567.919, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "negotiating.", "start": 1570.88, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "The central question", "start": 1573.279, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "remain before us. Membership,", "start": 1575.679, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "the veto, regional representation, the", "start": 1579.44, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "size and working methods of the security", "start": 1583.279, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "council and its relationship with this", "start": 1585.919, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "general assembly.", "start": 1589.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "The world has not stood still while we", "start": 1592.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "have been debating these issues.", "start": 1594.88, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "In the pact for the future, member", "start": 1598.0, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "states agreed that redressing the", "start": 1600.4, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "historical injustice against Africa must", "start": 1603.2, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "be a priority in the security council", "start": 1606.559, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "reform.", "start": 1609.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "We should not accept that reform is", "start": 1611.76, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "impossible because it is difficult.", "start": 1614.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "This organization has changed its", "start": 1617.679, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "architecture before.", "start": 1620.08, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "In 1963,", "start": 1622.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "this general assembly adopted amendments", "start": 1624.4, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "to enlarge the security council.", "start": 1627.36, "duration": 9.199}, {"text": "The council grew from 11 members to 15", "start": 1630.559, "duration": 9.281}, {"text": "because member states recognized that", "start": 1636.559, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "the institution had to respond to a", "start": 1639.84, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "changing membership.", "start": 1642.799, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "What was possible then,", "start": 1646.799, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen, is possible today.", "start": 1649.36, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "Reform must deliver equitable and", "start": 1653.279, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "permanent representation", "start": 1657.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "with all the prerogatives and privileges", "start": 1660.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "of permanent membership", "start": 1663.12, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "to Africa", "start": 1665.52, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and other deserving regions.", "start": 1667.6, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Political reform and financial reform", "start": 1670.96, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "are not separate projects. They ask the", "start": 1674.72, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "same fundamental question. Whether the", "start": 1678.399, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "institutions that govern our common", "start": 1681.279, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "future will reflect the sovereign", "start": 1683.2, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "equality they proclaim or preserve", "start": 1685.2, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "inequalities inherited from another age.", "start": 1688.96, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "More than half a century ago, this", "start": 1693.84, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "general assembly called for a new", "start": 1695.919, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "international economic order founded on", "start": 1698.24, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "sovereign equality, interdependence, and", "start": 1701.44, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "cooperation among states.", "start": 1704.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "We need not recreate the debates of", "start": 1707.039, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "another era, but we must ask the", "start": 1709.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "question they left unfinished.", "start": 1712.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "What does equality among nations require", "start": 1715.6, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "in the world of today?", "start": 1719.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "It requires a world in which no", "start": 1724.32, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "continent is permanently excluded from", "start": 1726.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "the highest decisions on peace and", "start": 1728.399, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "security.", "start": 1730.72, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "A world in which international law does", "start": 1732.48, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "not change with the identity of the", "start": 1734.799, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "state to which it is applied.", "start": 1737.279, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "A world in which a nation's prospects", "start": 1740.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "are not determined by how expensive the", "start": 1742.799, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "world has decided its capital to be.", "start": 1745.6, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "It requires that no child lose a", "start": 1750.159, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "classroom because debt service came", "start": 1753.44, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "fast. That no mother finds an empty", "start": 1755.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "clinic because essential investment", "start": 1758.799, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "became unaffordable.", "start": 1761.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "And that the resources of developing", "start": 1763.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "countries became foundations for their", "start": 1765.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "prosperity rather than pathways for", "start": 1768.32, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "extraction.", "start": 1771.2, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General, as you approach", "start": 1773.84, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "the conclusion of your stewardship of", "start": 1776.88, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "this great organization,", "start": 1779.2, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Africa recognizes your steadfast", "start": 1781.52, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "advocacy for a fairer international", "start": 1784.08, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "financial architecture, greater African", "start": 1786.799, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "representation, and a stronger voice for", "start": 1789.919, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "the global south.", "start": 1792.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "You have reminded the world that", "start": 1794.88, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "dignity, equality, and representation", "start": 1797.12, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "are not favors, but principles to be", "start": 1801.2, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "upheld.", "start": 1804.88, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "And perhaps the greatest tribute to your", "start": 1806.799, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "stewardship will be to turn the reforms", "start": 1810.08, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "you championed into reality.", "start": 1813.679, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Distinguished delegates, 81 years ago,", "start": 1817.76, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "the founders of this organization looked", "start": 1820.559, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "upon a broken world and chose not to", "start": 1823.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "preserve the order that had failed them.", "start": 1826.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "They built a new order. Our", "start": 1828.88, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "responsibility is no less consequential", "start": 1832.08, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "today. We must not wait for another", "start": 1835.2, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "catastrophe to reform this institution", "start": 1838.24, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "whose weaknesses we can already see.", "start": 1840.64, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "We must not ask our children to inherit", "start": 1844.96, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "wars that we can prevent or debts that", "start": 1847.919, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "we can make sustainable, inequalities we", "start": 1853.12, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "can correct, and institutions we know no", "start": 1856.799, "duration": 8.721}, {"text": "longer reflect the world we live in.", "start": 1861.2, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "If we are serious about restoring trust,", "start": 1865.52, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "and I'm sure we are, then rules must", "start": 1869.279, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "apply consistently.", "start": 1872.32, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "If we are serious about managing", "start": 1874.32, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "transformation as it is and as has been", "start": 1876.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "stated", "start": 1880.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "then our institutions must themselves", "start": 1882.64, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "reform and transform. And if we seek a", "start": 1885.76, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "united nations that delivers for all", "start": 1889.6, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "then all must have a meaningful voice a", "start": 1892.64, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "fair opportunity and a stake in the", "start": 1897.12, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "system.", "start": 1900.399, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "Let ours be the generation that", "start": 1902.159, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "completes the unfinished work of San", "start": 1904.08, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "Francisco.", "start": 1906.32, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "That makes sovereign equality real in", "start": 1908.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "our institutions, makes international", "start": 1910.0, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "law consistent in its application, makes", "start": 1912.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "capital serve development, and makes", "start": 1915.919, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "cooperation stronger than division.", "start": 1918.88, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "Not a United Nations of some nations,", "start": 1922.799, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "not a system in which power determines", "start": 1925.919, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "whose voice matter, but a United Nations", "start": 1928.0, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "worthy of its name, where every nation", "start": 1931.519, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "has a voice, every people have a stake,", "start": 1934.96, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "and every child has a future. That is", "start": 1938.48, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "the United Nations Kenya believes in.", "start": 1942.799, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "That is multilateralism Africa is ready", "start": 1945.84, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "to build. And that is the promise of our", "start": 1948.88, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "generation", "start": 1952.0, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "that we must keep. I thank you for your", "start": 1954.159, "duration": 8.681}, {"text": "attention. Thank you very much.", "start": 1958.08, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1967.76, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "thank the president of the Republic of", "start": 1970.08, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Kenya and commanderin-chief of the", "start": 1972.799, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "defense forces.", "start": 1975.6, "duration": 3.559}, {"text": "It's not simply whether finance", "start": 1982.24, "duration": 3.76}]